      "cancellationWindowHours": 24,
      "reminderOffsetsMin": [1440, 180],
      "policyText": "Tables are held for 15 minutes past your time. Plans change — just let us know by the day before and we’ll free your table for someone else. We’ll send a reminder the day before and a few hours ahead."
