      "depositType": "none",
      "cancellationWindowHours": 12,
      "reminderOffsetsMin": [180],
      "policyText": "Bar stools are the loosest booking we do — grab them for a glass and a plate. If you can’t make it, a quick heads-up frees them for the next walk-in."
